stateDiagram-v2
    state "Step 1: Intake — task registered [INTAKE]" as INTAKE
    state "Step 2: Interview — baseline and adaptive questions [INTERVIEW]" as INTERVIEW
    state "Step 3: Draft plan authored [DRAFT_PLAN]" as DRAFT_PLAN
    state "Step 4: Plan disposition & acceptance gate [PLAN_REVIEW]" as PLAN_REVIEW
    state "Step 5: Independent plan review — 1 or N rounds [MULTI_AGENT_REVIEW]" as MULTI_AGENT_REVIEW
    state "Step 6: Awaiting your approval [AWAITING_APPROVAL]" as AWAITING_APPROVAL
    state "Step 7: Approved — you said go [APPROVED]" as APPROVED
    state "Step 8: Implementation (isolated worktree) [IN_WORKTREE]" as IN_WORKTREE
    state "Step 9: Here's what changed — initial review [WORKTREE_REVIEW]" as WORKTREE_REVIEW
    state "Step 10: Multi-agent code review — 1 or N rounds [MULTI_AGENT_CODE_REVIEW]" as MULTI_AGENT_CODE_REVIEW
    state "Step 11: Verifying (tests, checks) [VERIFY_EXIT]" as VERIFY_EXIT
    state "Step 12: Retrospective — survey questions [RETROSPECTIVE]" as RETROSPECTIVE
    state "Step 13: Done [DONE]" as DONE

    [*] --> INTAKE
    INTAKE --> INTERVIEW
    INTERVIEW --> RETROSPECTIVE : trivial path — baseline<br/>and adaptive questions complete
    INTERVIEW --> DRAFT_PLAN : standard path — interview complete
    DRAFT_PLAN --> PLAN_REVIEW : submit plan<br/>choose additional review - yes or no
    PLAN_REVIEW --> MULTI_AGENT_REVIEW : yes — choose review method
    PLAN_REVIEW --> AWAITING_APPROVAL : no / plan accepted<br/>skip or review outcome recorded
    PLAN_REVIEW --> DRAFT_PLAN : changes requested<br/>revise artifacts and resubmit
    MULTI_AGENT_REVIEW --> PLAN_REVIEW : review complete<br/>merge outcome - repeat or accept
    MULTI_AGENT_REVIEW --> DRAFT_PLAN : changes requested<br/>revise artifacts and resubmit
    AWAITING_APPROVAL --> APPROVED : you say Proceed / Go<br/>(mandatory gate)
    APPROVED --> IN_WORKTREE
    APPROVED --> RETROSPECTIVE : approved plan — human skips implementation
    IN_WORKTREE --> WORKTREE_REVIEW : implementation + focused tests + inventory done
    WORKTREE_REVIEW --> MULTI_AGENT_CODE_REVIEW : you say yes<br/>then choose method/runtime/model/effort
    WORKTREE_REVIEW --> VERIFY_EXIT : you say no — skip straight ahead
    MULTI_AGENT_CODE_REVIEW --> WORKTREE_REVIEW : review package ready for re-submission
    MULTI_AGENT_CODE_REVIEW --> IN_WORKTREE : bounded changes<br/>synthesis + human approval
    MULTI_AGENT_CODE_REVIEW --> VERIFY_EXIT : review passed or explicitly skipped
    VERIFY_EXIT --> RETROSPECTIVE : ledger + full/task tests + leak check + map-debt pass
    RETROSPECTIVE --> DONE : survey complete or explicitly skipped<br/>with reason
    INTAKE --> DONE : force close — interactive human authorization<br/>(available from any active state)
    DONE --> [*]

    note right of DONE
        Any-state force-close is available only
        with explicit human authorization.
    end note

    note right of IN_WORKTREE
        Implementation dispatch, review, synthesis, and
        bounded fixes continue under controller ownership.
        Rework returns through IN_WORKTREE and review;
        no commit, push, or merge is implied.
    end note
